        "es": "Rocket.Chat is an open-source, self-hosted communication platform designed for organizations needing secure, real-time messaging. Built with Meteor and TypeScript, it supports end-to-end encryption, federated messaging via Matrix, and extensive customization through apps and integrations. Unlike proprietary tools, it gives full data control and can be deployed on-premises or in private clouds. Use it to build a compliant, mission-critical collaboration hub for teams, with features like omnichannel support, file sharing, and WebRTC video calls.",
