      "summaries": {
        "en": "Continue is an open-source coding agent that integrates AI into your IDE, helping you generate, refactor, and debug code without leaving your editor. It leverages a modular architecture supporting multiple LLM backends (e.g., GPT-4, Claude, local models) and provides a customizable agent loop for context-aware code transformations. You can use it to automate repetitive tasks, explore codebases, or build custom AI-powered workflows by extending its plugin system.",
        "zh": "Continue 是一个开源编码代理，将 AI 直接嵌入你的 IDE，让你在不离开编辑器的情况下完成代码生成、重构和调试。其核心优势在于模块化架构：支持 GPT-4、Claude 及本地模型等多种 LLM 后端，并通过可定制的代理循环实现上下文感知的代码转换。你可以用它自动化重复性任务、快速理解陌生代码库，或通过插件系统构建专属的 AI 工作流。例如，配置一个自动添加单元测试的代理，或让 AI 在审查 PR 时提供修改建议。",
        "es": "Continue is an open-source coding agent that integrates AI into your IDE, helping you generate, refactor, and debug code without leaving your editor. It leverages a modular architecture supporting multiple LLM backends (e.g., GPT-4, Claude, local models) and provides a customizable agent loop for context-aware code transformations. You can use it to automate repetitive tasks, explore codebases, or build custom AI-powered workflows by extending its plugin system.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "continue stands out for agent, ai, and cli in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Continue is an open-source coding agent that integrates AI into your IDE, helping you generate, refactor, and debug code without leaving your editor. It leverages a modular architecture supporting multiple LLM backends (e.g., GPT-4, Claude, local models) and provides a customizable agent loop for context-aware code transformations. You can use it to automate repetitive tasks, explore codebases, or build custom AI-powered workflows by extending its plugin system.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/continuedev/continue for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
