      "summaries": {
        "en": "Codebase Memory MCP is a high-performance server that indexes entire codebases into a persistent knowledge graph, enabling instant code understanding. Its key innovation is using a custom AST parser and graph database to achieve sub-millisecond queries while reducing token usage by 99% for LLM context. You can integrate it with tools like Claude Code or Cursor to get instant, context-aware code assistance without re-indexing.",
        "zh": "Codebase Memory MCP 是一个高性能代码智能 MCP 服务器，能将整个代码库索引为持久化的知识图谱，实现毫秒级代码理解。其核心技术在于使用自定义 AST 解析器与图数据库，将代码结构转化为可查询的图数据，查询速度低于毫秒，同时为 LLM 上下文减少 99% 的 token 消耗。你可以将其集成到 Claude Code、Cursor 等开发工具中，获得即时、上下文感知的代码辅助，无需重复索引。该工具支持 158 种编程语言，单静态二进制文件无依赖，适合大型项目快速导航与智能问答。",
        "es": "Codebase Memory MCP is a high-performance server that indexes entire codebases into a persistent knowledge graph, enabling instant code understanding. Its key innovation is using a custom AST parser and graph database to achieve sub-millisecond queries while reducing token usage by 99% for LLM context. You can integrate it with tools like Claude Code or Cursor to get instant, context-aware code assistance without re-indexing.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "codebase-memory-mcp stands out for aider, ast, and claude-code in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Codebase Memory MCP is a high-performance server that indexes entire codebases into a persistent knowledge graph, enabling instant code understanding. Its key innovation is using a custom AST parser and graph database to achieve sub-millisecond queries while reducing token usage by 99% for LLM context. You can integrate it with tools like Claude Code or Cursor to get instant, context-aware code assistance without re-indexing.",
