        "en": "OpenMontage is the first open-source agentic video production system that transforms AI coding assistants into full video studios. It orchestrates 12 pipelines, 52 tools, and 500+ agent skills to automate tasks like scriptwriting, voiceover, image generation, and editing. Technically, it uses a modular agent framework where LLMs (e.g., Claude, GPT) coordinate specialized tools via structured prompts. You can integrate it with Cursor or Copilot, or run it standalone to produce videos from simple text prompts. Ideal for rapid prototyping, educational content, or social media videos.",
        "zh": "OpenMontage是全球首个开源智能体视频制作系统，可将AI编程助手（如Cursor、Copilot）转化为完整视频工作室。系统通过12条流水线、52个工具及500余项智能体技能，自动完成脚本撰写、配音、图像生成与剪辑。其核心技术为模块化智能体框架，大语言模型（如Claude、GPT）借助结构化提示词协调专用工具，实现端到端视频创作。用户可集成至现有编码助手或独立运行，仅需输入文字即可生成视频，适用于快速原型制作、教育内容或社交媒体短视频，显著降低视频制作门槛。",
        "es": "OpenMontage is the first open-source agentic video production system that transforms AI coding assistants into full video studios. It orchestrates 12 pipelines, 52 tools, and 500+ agent skills to automate tasks like scriptwriting, voiceover, image generation, and editing. Technically, it uses a modular agent framework where LLMs (e.g., Claude, GPT) coordinate specialized tools via structured prompts. You can integrate it with Cursor or Copilot, or run it standalone to produce videos from simple text prompts. Ideal for rapid prototyping, educational content, or social media videos.",
